<title>NETHERLANDS: Aegon launches $1.25 bln ECP programme.</title>
<headline>Aegon launches $1.25 bln ECP programme.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch insurer Aegon NV said on Monday it would launch a $1.25 billion euro commercial paper programme.</p>
<p>The programme will replace a one billion guilder commercial paper programme and a $500 million eurocommercial paper programme, Aegon said in a statement.</p>
